COMMON['data_io']={**COMMON['command'],
 9:pair('一般 I/O 的成功 CQE 不是 Asynchronous Event。若另外發生符合定義的健康警告或錯誤事件，再依事件條件、AEC 設定及等待中的 AER 回報；故意製造一次 Compare 不相符，不能直接要求出現硬體故障通知。 || An ordinary successful I/O CQE is not an asynchronous event. Separately qualifying health/error events use their own conditions, AEC settings and outstanding requests. An intentional comparison mismatch does not by itself require a hardware-failure notice.'),
 10:pair('保留原始命令、CQE、資料與 metadata，再按實際命令種類核對 SMART 計數。More=1 時讀取相符的 Error Information；More=0 不代表禁止建立 entry，也不是每個失敗都必須新增 entry。計數或 Log 不能代替資料內容與範圍的核對。 || Preserve the request, completion, data and metadata, then interpret SMART counters for the actual command. More=1 calls for correlated Error Information; More=0 neither prohibits an entry nor makes one mandatory for every failure. Logs and counters do not replace checking data and ranges.'),
 11:pair('一般 Read、Write、Compare 或 Copy 不是 PEL 的逐筆命令歷史。若操作期間另有受支援的硬體、健康或電源事件，才依該事件的記錄條件檢查 PEL；不能因為有一筆失敗 CQE，就要求一筆同名 Persistent Event。 || PEL is not a per-command Read/Write/Compare/Copy trace. Check separately supported hardware, health or power events under their recording conditions; a failed CQE alone does not require a matching named persistent event.'),
 12:pair('Controller Level Reset 使原 I/O queues 與未完成命令的追蹤關係失效，但不會替 Host 撤銷已發生的資料修改。恢復後重建 queue，再查受影響 LBA；未完成寫入允許出現哪些結果，仍要配合有效原子單位、邊界及命令規則判斷。 || Controller Level Reset invalidates I/O queues and outstanding-command tracking without rolling back prior data changes. Rebuild queues and inspect affected LBAs. Permitted interrupted-write results depend on effective atomic units, boundaries and the command.'),
 13:pair('Subsystem Reset 後，受影響的 controllers 都要恢復命令通道。這不是清除 namespace 內容的操作，也不是重送所有舊 I/O 的理由；先確認操作結果及共用資料是否已被其他路徑更新，再決定後續動作。 || Restore command paths on all controllers affected by subsystem reset. Reset neither erases namespace contents nor authorizes blindly replaying every old I/O. Establish operation results and concurrent shared-data changes first.'),
 14:pair('Power Cycle 後，先分清「命令已成功完成且資料符合持久性要求」與「命令在寫入途中被中斷」。前者核對已提交到非揮發媒體的資料；後者依斷電原子性與命令專屬規則判讀。另行重新查詢 Feature，不能把暫存設定的恢復方式當成資料保留規則。 || After a power cycle, distinguish a successful persistent write from an interrupted write. Verify committed data in the former case and power-fail atomicity/command-specific outcomes in the latter. Rediscover feature state separately; configuration restoration is not a data-retention rule.'),
 15:pair('I/O 以指定 namespace 及 LBA 範圍為主要對象。共享 namespace 的其他 controllers 會存取同一份邏輯資料，因此讀回驗證前要排除其他寫入者。命令從哪條 queue 送入，不能用來推論資料只屬於該 controller。 || I/O targets a namespace and LBA range. Other controllers attached to a shared namespace access the same logical data, so exclude concurrent writers before readback verification. Submission queue ownership does not make the data private to that controller.'),
}

